  comment Asserts complete operational support for UNet 2D ResNet convolutions, Cross-Attention DeepSeek conditioning, Moondreams Vision Patch tokens, VAE Latent Space Bijectivity, and DDIM Reverse Stochastic Trajectories;

  integer unetConv2d, crossAttnDeepSeek, moondreamsVision, vaeLatentBiject, ddimNoiseReversal, fullDiffusionProven;

